                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 125.0012/85a.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Carothers.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-04-25T20:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 25, 1914, 8 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Durango and Torreon were instructed by telegraph April 24:</p>
                <p>[Quotes text of first above telegram of April 24, 2 p.m.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
